This is useful for resource control and preventing one container from consuming excessive host resources.
Note: Compose resource-limit syntax has some differences depending on whether you're using regular Docker Compose or Swarm-style deploy.resources. For normal Docker Compose, mem_limit and cpus are straightforward options.
